cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the SilicaMS version used. When inherited silica-construction methods
  are relevant, also cite the PoreMS framework paper and the Vink-Barkema
  vitreous-silica reference identified in this file.
title: SilicaMS
type: software
version: 0.5.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/DrDomenicoMarson/SilicaMS
url: https://drdomenicomarson.github.io/SilicaMS/
